          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "8B53AE341D6CAE18",
      "text": "我之所以能遇見霜奶仙，\\n也是因為[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳叫我來學園的關係。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
