    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "8B53AF341D6CAFCB",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳去過了各地，\\n想必有過許多美好的邂逅吧。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
