    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "8B53B2341D6CB4E4",
      "text": "我覺得自己似乎參與了\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的一部分冒險。\\c\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學，\\n感謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳和我交換。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
