    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "83F9DA1698AEA078",
      "text": "這可不像[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳啊。\\n是不是心不在焉？\\c\\n好好照顧身體，\\n並且慰勞寶可夢們吧。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
