    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "F7F652B98B85042B",
      "text": "我有一堂課備受好評，內容是製作\\n給寶可夢在戰鬥後吃的健康料理。\\r\\n下次[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也來上上看吧？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
