    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "F7F651B98B850278",
      "text": "原來在生態巨蛋\\n也會下雨啊。\\c\\n看來在野餐時會突然遇上下雨這回事，\\n在巨蛋裡也沒什麼不同呢。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
